title Vinyl: a one-hour track (h:mm:ss on both sides of the seek bar) on a USB DAC with a long name (the output chip on a row of its own on the large layout, the output button elsewhere; 640x480: qa-640-long, 480x320 and 320x480: qa-long-small)
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LONG 1

wait 1200
shot 01-now-long
expect esc
expect text "0:01:14"
expect text "-1:01:16"
expect text "70"
expect text "USB Audio Device"
key b
wait 400
shot 02-browser-long
key o
wait 400
shot 03-output-long
expect text "USB Audio Device"
key left
wait 300
key esc
expect quit
